# Q Proxy has no required secrets — all state lives in KV.
# This file is a template for local dev only. Copy to .dev.vars if you need
# to test with remote KV (wrangler dev --remote) and need Cloudflare auth
# via env vars (see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md).
#
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your_token_here
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your_account_id_here

# No Worker secrets required.
